<div class="wrap">
  <section class="ch" id="travel"><p class="ch__num">13 · Care</p><h2>Travel and flights</h2><p class="ch__lead">The battery is well under the 100 Wh carry-on limit. Its rating is printed on the battery label.</p><div class="temps"><div><b>56 Wh</b><span>15,150 mAh · 3.7 V · 56.055 Wh, on the label</span></div><div><b>Cabin bag</b><span>The battery travels with you, never in checked luggage</span></div><div><b>Either bag</b><span>Diamond itself, without the battery, can go in checked luggage</span></div></div><div class="note note--tip"><b>Before you fly</b><ul><li>Take the battery out and pack it in your cabin bag.</li><li>Airlines set their own rules: check yours before you travel.</li></ul></div></section>
  <section class="ch" id="donts"><p class="ch__num">14 · Care</p><h2>Keep it safe</h2><p class="ch__lead">Diamond is easy to live with. Water on the battery or its contacts is the one thing it really does not like.</p><div class="safe"><div class="safe__row"><h3>Water and the contacts</h3><div class="safe__pair"><figure class="safe__no">{%- if section.settings.dont_water_bay != blank -%}{{- section.settings.dont_water_bay | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.dont_water_bay.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.dont_water_bay.width, height: section.settings.dont_water_bay.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-dont-water-bay.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}<figcaption><i>✕</i><b>Don't</b><span>Water into the battery bay</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="safe__ok">{%- if section.settings.rinse_shaft != blank -%}{{- section.settings.rinse_shaft | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.rinse_shaft.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.rinse_shaft.width, height: section.settings.rinse_shaft.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-ok-rinse-shaft.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}<figcaption><i>✓</i><b>Do</b><span>Rinse the chamber from the top, battery fitted</span></figcaption></figure></div></div><div class="safe__row"><h3>The battery</h3><div class="safe__pair"><figure class="safe__no">{%- if section.settings.dont_water_battery != blank -%}{{- section.settings.dont_water_battery | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.dont_water_battery.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.dont_water_battery.width, height: section.settings.dont_water_battery.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-dont-water-battery.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}<figcaption><i>✕</i><b>Don't</b><span>Water over the battery</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="safe__ok">{%- if section.settings.before_charge != blank -%}{{- section.settings.before_charge | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.before_charge.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.before_charge.width, height: section.settings.before_charge.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-before-charge.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}<figcaption><i>✓</i><b>Do</b><span>Dry, and charged once it has cooled</span></figcaption></figure></div></div><div class="safe__row"><h3>Cooling down</h3><div class="safe__pair"><figure class="safe__no">{%- if section.settings.dont_covered_soft != blank -%}{{- section.settings.dont_covered_soft | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.dont_covered_soft.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.dont_covered_soft.width, height: section.settings.dont_covered_soft.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-dont-covered-soft.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}<figcaption><i>✕</i><b>Don't</b><span>Covered up on a sofa</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="safe__ok">{%- if section.settings.on_hookah != blank -%}{{- section.settings.on_hookah | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.on_hookah.alt | default: '', width: section.settings.on_hookah.width, height: section.settings.on_hookah.height -}}{%- else -%}<img src="{{ 'dm-s-on-hookah-front.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}<figcaption><i>✓</i><b>Do</b><span>In the open, on a hard surface</span></figcaption></figure></div></div></div><div class="note note--dont"><b>If water gets in</b><ul><li>Do not switch Diamond on. Let it cool down and dry out completely.</li><li>Water on the contacts or inside the body is not covered by the warranty.</li></ul></div></section>
  <section class="ch" id="troubleshooting"><p class="ch__num">15 · Help</p><h2>Troubleshooting</h2><p class="ch__lead">Most things are one step away.</p><h3>Power and battery</h3><div class="faq"><details><summary>Diamond does not switch on</summary><p>Check that the paper tab is off the battery contacts, that the battery sits in with the latch closed and that it is charged. Then hold the dial for 3 seconds.</p></details><details><summary>Heating stopped mid-session</summary><p>The battery reached about 2–3 %. Plug in USB-C, or switch off and fit a charged battery. <b>Continue Session?</b> picks up where you were.</p></details><details><summary>Continue Session? did not appear</summary><p>It only shows while the chamber is still hot. If it has cooled, start a new pre-heat.</p></details><details><summary>The battery does not charge</summary><p>Let it cool first. Use a 30 W USB-C supply, try another cable, or charge the battery on its own.</p></details></div><h3>Flavour and smoke</h3><div class="faq"><details><summary>Weak flavour, little smoke</summary><p>Go up 10 °C, open the plate a step, pack a little denser or pre-heat a minute longer.</p></details><details><summary>Harsh or burnt taste</summary><p>Turn the dial down, lift the cap off, blow gently over the tobacco and let it cool for a moment, then cap back on. Next time pack looser, or try the basket mesh.</p></details><details><summary>A smell from the last session</summary><p>Rinse the chamber from the top and brush the shaft, then let it dry fully.</p></details></div><h3>Fit and draw</h3><div class="faq"><details><summary>No draw at all</summary><p>The plate is fully closed: turn it open a step. Also check the adapter and the hookah seals.</p></details><details><summary>Diamond wobbles on the stem</summary><p>Take it off, set the adapter only half-way onto the stem, put Diamond on top and press: they slide down together and sit firm. Still loose? Try the other adapter.</p></details><details><summary>The cup will not come out</summary><p>Let Diamond cool. Twist the cup gently, carefully so it does not crack. Still stuck? Press lightly around the rim to rock it loose, then lift it out with the tool.</p></details></div><h3>Screen and settings</h3><div class="faq"><details><summary>The dial turns but nothing changes</summary><p>It is locked: a lock shows on the screen. Click four times.</p></details><details><summary>The screen is too dark or too bright</summary><p>Menu › Brightness.</p></details><details><summary>No sound when pre-heat finishes</summary><p>Menu › Sound Volume: it may be at zero.</p></details><details><summary>My settings look different</summary><p>Check which profile is on: the colour and the dots at the bottom tell you. Menu › Profiles to switch back.</p></details><details><summary>Which firmware do I have?</summary><p>With Diamond switched off, click the dial <b>five times</b>. The version shows on the screen.</p></details><details><summary>Back to factory settings</summary><p>With Diamond switched off, click <b>seven times and hold</b>. Profiles and settings return to how they left the factory.</p></details></div><p class="tsmore"><a class="tsmore__b" href="/pages/enso-diamond-app#diamond-fix">Open the full troubleshooter</a><span>Step by step, for every problem</span></p></section>
  <section class="ch" id="warranty"><p class="ch__num">16 · Help</p><h2>Warranty and support</h2><p class="ch__lead">Two years on Diamond, one year on the battery.</p><p>Write to <a href="mailto:support@ensoshisha.eu">support@ensoshisha.eu</a> with your order number and a short description or a photo. <a href="../partner-v2/warranty.html">Read the warranty terms →</a></p></section>
</div>

